<title>GERMANY: W.German prelim Sept CPI inflation 1.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>W.German prelim Sept CPI inflation 1.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PRELIM W.GERMAN INFLATION    Sep 96	   Aug 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   -0.1	     -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	   +1.4	     +1.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		  n/a	    114.5</p>
<p>Note - The new figures are provisional. The Office will publish final figures in mid-October. -- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
